  "card": "Enables the `-Wunused-const-variable` compiler flag and marks header constants in `logging.h` and `mempool_estimator.h` as `inline constexpr`. Without `inline`, header-scoped constants receive internal linkage and trigger compiler errors in translation units where they are unused. This PR is extracted as a prerequisite for enabling the broader `-Wunused` warning set in #36167.",
